### Evaluation scripts

- Folding tasks (CASP14/CAMEO22): use [analyze_folding.py](mdc:src/simplefold/evaluation/analyze_folding.py). Requires OpenStructure 2.9.1 docker.
- Two-state (Apo/CoDNaS): use [analyze_two_state.py](mdc:src/simplefold/evaluation/analyze_two_state.py) with compiled TM-score.
- Utilities for plotting and metrics under [two_state_utils](mdc:src/simplefold/evaluation/two_state_utils/).

